 "label": "Xbox Game Pass Ultimate",
 "isHomepage": false,
 "description": "<p>Xbox Game Pass Ultimate combines three different services:</p><ul><li>Xbox Game Pass on Xbox One</li><li>Xbox Game Pass on PC</li><li>Xbox Live Gold</li></ul><p>The Xbox Game Pass gives subscribers access to Xbox exclusives the day they release, such as Forza, Halo, Gears of War, and more. Subscribers may also receive a 10% - 20% discount on some digital purchases on Microsoft's platforms.</p><p>It currently costs $19.99 / 17,99 € per month.</p><p>Subscribe now at the <a href=\"https://sovrn.co/0vfsa3s\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Microsoft store</a>, and be sure to check out the store for the most up-to-date game listings for your region.</p>",
